<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Maker Garage Support - Get help with your account, projects, orders, payments, and more." />
  <title>Maker Garage Support</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0f0f0f;
      --card: #181818;
      --card-2: #202020;
      --text: #f4f4f4;
      --muted: #a7a7a7;
      --border: #353535;
      --accent: #ff5a00;
      --accent-hover: #ff6f1f;
      --max: 980px;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .wrap { width: min(92%, var(--max)); margin: 0 auto; }
    header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(15, 15, 15, 0.96);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 10;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }
    .nav {
      min-height: 72px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .brand {
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .brand span { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    .hero {
      padding: 96px 0 64px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--accent);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 8vw, 78px);
      line-height: 1;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }
    .hero p {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .actions {
      margin-top: 30px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 48px;
      padding: 0 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card);
    }
    .btn.primary {
      background: var(--accent);
      border-color: var(--accent);
      color: white;
    }
    .btn.primary:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); }
    .btn.secondary:hover { background: var(--card-2); }
    section { padding: 28px 0 64px; }
    h2 { font-size: 30px; margin: 0 0 20px; }
    .grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .card h3 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 20px; }
    .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .faq { display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    details {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
    }
    summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; }
    details p { color: var(--muted); margin: 12px 0 0; }
    .contact-box {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #1b1b1b, #151515);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      padding: 32px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .contact-box p {
      color: var(--muted);
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 auto 18px;
    }
    .small-note {
      margin-top: 14px;
      color: #7f7f7f;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 30px 0 48px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .footer-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 18px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--text); }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero { padding-top: 72px; }
      .nav { min-height: 64px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="wrap nav">
      <div class="brand">Maker <span>Garage</span></div>
      <a href="#contact">Contact Support</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="eyebrow">Support</div>
        <h1>How can we help?</h1>
        <p>
          Get help with Maker Garage accounts, projects, orders, payments,
          selling, custom build requests, and other app questions.
        </p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=maker9garage@gmail.com&su=Maker%20Garage%20Support" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Email Support</a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="#faq">View FAQs</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Support topics</h2>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Account & Sign In</h3>
            <p>Help with creating an account, signing in, profile settings, and account access.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Projects & Reels</h3>
            <p>Help publishing projects, uploading media, editing project details, and project Reels.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Orders & Shipping</h3>
            <p>Questions about purchases, order status, tracking, delivery, returns, and buyer protection.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Selling & Payouts</h3>
            <p>Help with selling projects, custom requests, Stripe setup, earnings, and payout status.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="faq">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
        <div class="faq">
          <details>
            <summary>How do I contact Maker Garage support?</summary>
            <p>Use the Email Support button on this page. Include the email address on your Maker Garage account and a short description of the issue. Do not send passwords or full payment card numbers.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Where can I check my order status?</summary>
            <p>Open Maker Garage and go to Orders. Select the order to view its current payment, shipping, tracking, delivery, or completion status.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How do seller payouts work?</summary>
            <p>Eligible sellers complete Stripe onboarding inside Maker Garage. Payout timing depends on the order status, delivery, buyer protection period, and any open return, report, or dispute.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How do I report a problem with an order or project?</summary>
            <p>Use the report or support options available in the Maker Garage app. Provide enough detail for the support team to investigate the issue.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How do I delete my account?</summary>
            <p>Use the account deletion option inside Maker Garage settings. If you cannot access your account, contact support using the email button on this page.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="contact-box">
          <h2>Still need help?</h2>
          <p>Contact Maker Garage support and include a clear description of the problem. For order-related issues, include the order ID when available.</p>
          <a class="btn primary" href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=maker9garage@gmail.com&su=Maker%20Garage%20Support" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Contact Support</a>
          <div class="small-note">Never send your password, complete card number, or other sensitive payment credentials by email.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footer-row">
      <div>© 2026 Maker Garage. All rights reserved.</div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="terms.html">Terms of Service</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
